      "id": "claim_de8a7e7c6d2640a9a0f72bb7778fbca1",
      "statement": "The application-level /api/health endpoint returns a static OK and does not verify the Redis connection; Redis reachability is instead observable via the actuator health endpoint, which application.properties exposes with management.endpoint.health.show-details=always, and spring data redis client activity is logged at DEBUG level by default.",
