      "id": "claim_89567b938c104c2f89b2b94d2d8722fd",
      "statement": "The redisTemplate bean is created without explicit serializer configuration, so Spring Data Redis' JDK-serialization defaults apply to keys and values; stored results therefore appear under binary-serialized keys (rather than the plain request-ID text) when inspected in RedisInsight or redis-cli.",
