      "id": "claim_e11daaa7c7b04129b47d7efb7d252487",
      "statement": "RedisAccessorTest is a @SpringBootTest that starts a real Redis via a Testcontainers redis:7.0-alpine GenericContainer and overrides spring.data.redis.host/port dynamically; it verifies the accessor semantics — save-then-get round-trip with the ID echoed back, keyExistsInDatabase turning true, overwriting an existing key, null/false for unknown keys, and IllegalArgumentException for a null key.",
